#: ../../.opencode/skills/release-and-deployment/SKILL.md:9
msgid "Core approach"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/release-and-deployment/SKILL.md:11
msgid "Treat releases as operational events, not just git events."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/release-and-deployment/SKILL.md:12
msgid ""
"Verify what is changing, how it will be deployed, and how it can be "
"rolled back."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/release-and-deployment/SKILL.md:13
msgid ""
"Surface migration coupling, environment assumptions, and release "
"sequencing risks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/release-and-deployment/SKILL.md:14
msgid "Prefer repeatable, documented release steps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/release-and-deployment/SKILL.md:16
msgid "Practical guidance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/release-and-deployment/SKILL.md:18
msgid ""
"Check versioning, release notes, deployment prerequisites, feature flags,"
" migrations, and rollback constraints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/release-and-deployment/SKILL.md:19
msgid ""
"Make sure release communication reflects user-visible or operator-visible"
" changes."
msgstr ""

